<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka benchmark 12-month T-bills unchanged.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka benchmark 12-month T-bills unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yields of 12-month treasury bills remained unchanged while three-months yields rose by 0.06 percentage points and six-month bills by 0.04 at Wednesday auction, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>		   Bids received   Bids accepted   Avg yield</p>
<p>    3 months	 955		 880	  10.76 (10.70)</p>
<p>    6 months	 520		 220	  11.69 (11.65)</p>
<p>    12 months	455		 345	  12.74 (12.74)</p>
<p>    Total	  1,930		1,445</p>
<p>NOTE - Bids in million rupees, yields in percent (previous week's yields in brackets).</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
